  id: aroofforthework
  displayName: A Roof for the Work
  description: 'What the woods give you is only wood and ore until there is somewhere to work it. Raise a Workshop beside the fire (build menu: {key:Build}). It mends what a raid wears down, squares Grey Stone into blocks and splits oak into rough planks, and the chest, the club and the bandages all start at its bench.'
  chain: The First Days
  journalNotes: 'The Workshop wants oak, grey stone and sticks: fell the oaks at the clearing''s edge with a hatchet and break the grey boulders with a pick. Repairs are made at its bench.'
